=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SILENCED_AURA</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SILENCED_AURA+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SILENCED_AURA+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Silenced\">Condition: Silenced</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;6 m (20 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;6 m (20 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Creature can't speak or cast spells with a verbal component, and is immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>